graph (x86, the real-graph tool with the fake DSP, perf stat): 3,691,856
before and 3,711,938 after (+0.54 %) with GGML_HEXAGON_BATCHCACHE=0, and
3,689,973 before and 3,715,434 after (+0.69 %) with the batch cache. The
tg32 of the phone check does not change.

